<<
/A 1183 0 R
/Alt (Scientific figure composed of multiple panels illustrating the effects of varying concentrations of a treatment \(0, 1.2, 2.4, and 4.8 millimolar\) on BMSC cells, including cell staining for proliferation \(Hoechst/EdU, A\), growth curves \(B\), reactive oxygen species \(ROS\) staining \(C, F\), mitochondrial membrane potential \(D\), assays for antioxidant and oxidative stress markers \(E\), transmission electron microscopy images showing ultrastructural changes \(G\), and Western blots for protein expression with corresponding quantification \(H, I, J\). Results consistently show concentration-dependent biological responses, with increased oxidative stress and altered protein expression at higher concentrations.)
